{"4115050": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Spectro: Phantom Tower", "steam_appid": 4115050, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>You've got to save Weirdwood! </strong>Overnight, a tower rose on the edge of town. At its summit waits the <strong>Mask of Okeem</strong> and the <strong>False King</strong> who guards it. Climb to the top of the tower, free the phantoms back to their realm, and return with the Mask to save the town.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4115050/extras/9377adec6026d92ab3dcfc810c7391fe.poster.avif?t=1765910824\" width=780 height=160 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4115050/extras/9377adec6026d92ab3dcfc810c7391fe.webm?t=1765910824\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4115050/extras/9377adec6026d92ab3dcfc810c7391fe.mp4?t=1765910824\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Spectro: Phantom Tower</strong> blends handcrafted design with procedural remixing, so every run looks curated and plays fresh, there is always “one more climb.”</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>BLAST, BUBBLE, CONTAIN</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4115050/extras/7b612760b920768c8a452e88d4322ba9.poster.avif?t=1765910824\" width=780 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4115050/extras/7b612760b920768c8a452e88d4322ba9.webm?t=1765910824\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4115050/extras/7b612760b920768c8a452e88d4322ba9.mp4?t=1765910824\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Blasting phantoms </strong>– Capture phantoms with blasters and other items, then free them to the Otherworld.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Builds that evolve</strong> – Mix a <strong>variety of blasters and items</strong> to discover new synergies each climb.</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>SECRETS AND TREASURES</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4115050/extras/bde187042b2ac92ee4419e2a905a8289.poster.avif?t=1765910824\" width=780 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4115050/extras/bde187042b2ac92ee4419e2a905a8289.webm?t=1765910824\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4115050/extras/bde187042b2ac92ee4419e2a905a8289.mp4?t=1765910824\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Hand-crafted rooms, endlessly remixed</strong> – Procedural layouts built from hand-crafted rooms and furniture make for <strong>infinite replayability</strong> with a crafted look.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Retrieve the Mask</strong> – Face the <strong>False King</strong> and <strong>return with the Mask of Okeem</strong> to win the run.</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>CHALLENGES ABOUND</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4115050/extras/9ded377060ed16b66622107ca2eb2e95.poster.avif?t=1765910824\" width=780 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4115050/extras/9ded377060ed16b66622107ca2eb2e95.webm?t=1765910824\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4115050/extras/9ded377060ed16b66622107ca2eb2e95.mp4?t=1765910824\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Floor challenges &amp; hidden keys</strong> – Find secret rooms, complete a variety of objectives, and power up your run with modifiers.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Pure roguelike loop</strong> – Learn the tower’s rhythms, improvise with what you find, and push a little higher every time.</p></li></ul>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>You've got to save Weirdwood! </strong>Overnight, a tower rose on the edge of town. At its summit waits the <strong>Mask of Okeem</strong> and the <strong>False King</strong> who guards it. Climb to the top of the tower, free the phantoms back to their realm, and return with the Mask to save the town.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4115050/extras/9377adec6026d92ab3dcfc810c7391fe.poster.avif?t=1765910824\" width=780 height=160 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4115050/extras/9377adec6026d92ab3dcfc810c7391fe.webm?t=1765910824\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4115050/extras/9377adec6026d92ab3dcfc810c7391fe.mp4?t=1765910824\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Spectro: Phantom Tower</strong> blends handcrafted design with procedural remixing, so every run looks curated and plays fresh, there is always “one more climb.”</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><str